Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.21,0:00:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, mă simt așa de înțepenită.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.69,0:00:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dori să-ți fac un masaj?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți face așa ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.32,0:00:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, exact așa. \NSe simte incredibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am fost concepută pentru a-mi ajuta stăpânul să se relaxeze.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pot face și masaje erotice,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar trebuie să fii înregistrată ca stăpân...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.66,0:00:27.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu! Unul normal e de ajuns!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.28,0:00:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar nu sunt destul \Nde bună pentru tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.46,0:00:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă urăști cumva, stăpână?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.84,0:00:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acelea sunt lacrimi de crocodil! \NTrebuie să rezist!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that. You're just too human-like.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.78,0:00:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Look, registering as your master \Nwould make me your owner, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.61,0:00:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But I can't treat you like property \Nwhen you look like a human girl.{sgt: ugh, I'm sure there's a better way to write this scene.}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.54,0:01:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how am I supposed to serve you?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.10,0:01:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Saying you're human-like is a compliment! \NYou're not useless.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.46,0:01:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sex is something that two humans do together!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.26,0:01:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stăpână!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.38,0:01:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, not that I know much about love or sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.10,0:01:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never dated or been in a physical relationship.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.48,0:01:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The most I've done is hold hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.19,0:01:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Anyway, I just think \Nthat we should start as friends first.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to be my friend, Master?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog să nu-mi mai spui „stăpână”.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci, cum ar trebui să-ți spun?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.17,0:01:38.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.65,0:01:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe nume.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pot să te sărut?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.45,0:01:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce mă întrebi asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.14,0:01:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ultima oară, te-ai supărat când te-am sărutat pe neașteptate.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu prea înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.77,0:02:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Adică o sărut în fiecare dimineață.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te iubesc, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.93,0:02:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Știam eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.81,0:02:26.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu pot spune nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.38,0:02:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane. Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te iubesc, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.42,0:02:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Parcă ar fi iubita mea
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}când îmi șoptește numele astfel.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.09,0:03:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă vei ajuta și pe mine să simt plăcere?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.46,0:03:28.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,încerci să mă faci să \Nmă înregistrez, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.38,0:03:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știam eu! Asta era intenția ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pot lăsa garda \Njos în preajma ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.44,0:03:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu... Îmi pare rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai supărat pe mine, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.88,0:03:46.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko, poți simți durere?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oarecum. Am fost \Nprogramată să evit daunele.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.82,0:03:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.89,0:03:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}M-aș fi simțit oribil dacă aș fi rănit-o.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-ar plăcea să mai facem \Nasta și altă dată, Akane.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.73,0:04:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Îmi pune inima pe jar de fiecare \Ndată când îmi spune numele.
